<title>UK: Iraq tenders for 120,000 T sugar under U.N. deal.</title>
<headline>Iraq tenders for 120,000 T sugar under U.N. deal.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iraq tendered to buy 120,000 tonnes of white sugar under the U.N. oil-for-food deal, London sugar traders said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The tender would be held on February 25, they added.</p>
</text>
